  "description": {
    "text": "From 2009 Challenge Hiroba events gave out new cards. At the March launch battles for Beat of the Frontier some handed out again the cosmos holo Pikachu 095/DP-P of Battle Road Spring 2008. From May each month brought a card for players: Chatot in May, Ponyta from June, with a banner for Advent of Arceus, Jigglypuff in August, and in September Meganium 001/L-P, with a banner for the coming LEGEND series. October's battles for the launch of HeartGold Collection and SoulSilver Collection gave every player Sentret 022/L-P, and their excellence prize was Professor Elm's Training Method 023/L-P.\n\nFive straight Card Get Battle wins won a silver Victory Medal showing Giratina, 031/DPt-P, and from November one showing Meganium, 041/L-P, when Wobbuffet became the players' card.",
